# 14. Model Classes + SQLite

You already learned model classes.

In a real application, you can combine them.

```text
SQLite
   ↓
Map
   ↓
User.fromJson()
   ↓
User object
   ↓
UI
```

And when saving:

```text
User object
   ↓
toMap()
   ↓
SQLite
```

For SQLite, developers commonly create methods such as:

```dart
Map<String, dynamic> toMap()
```

and:

```dart
factory User.fromMap(Map<String, dynamic> map)
```

The idea is very similar to `fromJson()` and `toJson()`.

