# 15. Real Example — Expense App

Imagine an expense tracker.

Table:

```text
expenses

id | title       | amount | category
---|-------------|--------|----------
1  | Lunch       | 150    | Food
2  | Bus         | 30     | Travel
3  | Movie       | 250    | Fun
```

Your app can:

```text
Add expense
     ↓
insert()

Show expenses
     ↓
query()

Edit expense
     ↓
update()

Delete expense
     ↓
delete()
```

Because the data is stored locally, the app can work without an internet connection.

