# 16. When Should You Use SQLite?

Use a local database when you need:

* Many records
* Structured data
* Searching
* Filtering
* Updating records
* Deleting records
* Offline functionality
* Relationships between data

Examples:

```text
Expense Tracker
Music Player
Notes App
Offline Shopping App
Contact Manager
Offline Book Library
```

---

# 17. SQLite vs SharedPreferences

| SharedPreferences | SQLite              |
| ----------------- | ------------------- |
| Simple values     | Structured records  |
| Key-value         | Tables/rows/columns |
| Settings          | App data            |
| Login flag        | Products            |
| Dark mode         | Expenses            |
| Username          | Songs               |
| Very simple       | More powerful       |

### Easy rule

```text
"Should I remember a setting?"
        ↓
SharedPreferences

"Should I store a collection of records?"
        ↓
SQLite
```

